<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Nov 29, compared with the Nov 22 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.30 vs 5.41</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.02 vs 5.03</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.42 vs 5.41</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.29 vs 5.28</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.38 vs 5.38</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.38 vs 5.38</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.41 vs 6.43</p>
</text>
